# Pillar hub content. Owner facts only — no invented clients, numbers, reviews.
P = {}

P['marketing'] = dict(
 slug='marketing.html', key='Marketing',
 title='Marketing Consultant in Dubai & India | YKS Productions',
 desc='Marketing consultant for brands in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Bangalore, Mumbai and Delhi: strategy, digital marketing, ads, SEO and content from one team.',
 h1='Marketing Consultant', h1em='for Dubai & India',
 eyebrow='Marketing · Strategy · Digital',
 lede='Strategy, digital marketing and the content that powers it, run by someone who has spent 8 years behind the camera for brands like Vaseline (Unilever) and Marriott. I&rsquo;m Yedukrishna Suresh, and YKS Productions is how I help brands across the UAE and India get found, get remembered and get enquiries.',
 imgs='mkt',
 sections=[
  ('What a marketing consultant actually does for you', [
   'Most businesses don&rsquo;t need more marketing activity. They need fewer, better decisions: who exactly they are selling to, what they want those people to believe, which two or three channels will carry that message, and what content each channel needs every month. That is the job of a marketing consultant, and it is the job I take on.',
   'YKS Productions sits in an unusual spot. Agencies are usually strong on decks and weak on the camera; freelancers are usually the opposite. I started as a photographer, videographer and content creator: still photographer on the Malayalam films Soothravakyam and Baby Girl, and on campaign and brand content for Vaseline (Unilever), Marriott, cricketer KL Rahul and Cindrebay School of Design. One campaign reel reached 3.3 million views, and my own Instagram, @yks_photoworks, has passed 1.4 million profile views. That background shapes how I do marketing: strategy that already knows what it will look like on screen.']),
  ('Digital marketing, end to end', [
   'Digital marketing is the umbrella for everything that happens online: your website, search visibility, social channels, paid ads, email and the content that feeds all of them. For a small or mid-sized brand the hard part isn&rsquo;t any single channel. It&rsquo;s keeping them pointed in the same direction. I set the strategy, plan the content calendar, shoot the photo and video myself, and run or coordinate the channels so every piece connects back to one goal, whether that&rsquo;s enquiries, bookings, store visits or sales.',
   'In practice that means a clear positioning document, a monthly content plan, a shoot schedule, campaigns on the platforms where your buyers actually spend time, and simple reporting so you can see what is working and what to stop doing.']),
  ('SEO services: being found when people search', [
   'Search is where intent lives. Someone typing &ldquo;real estate videographer Dubai&rdquo; or &ldquo;brand shoot Bangalore&rdquo; already wants what you sell. My SEO work focuses on the practical foundations: clear service pages that answer what buyers actually ask, local SEO and Google Business Profile hygiene, page titles and descriptions written for clicks, structured data, fast pages and images with real alt text, and a content plan of genuinely useful articles.',
   'I don&rsquo;t sell link schemes or guaranteed rankings. Nobody honest can promise position one. What I can do is make your site the clearest, most useful answer for the searches that matter to your business, and keep improving it from Search Console data.']),
  ('How I choose the channels', [
   'Channel choice follows the buyer, not fashion. A luxury hospitality brand in Dubai lives on Instagram and Google Maps. A B2B SaaS company in Bangalore needs LinkedIn and search. A fashion label in Mumbai needs reels, creators and Meta ads. A coaching institute in Delhi NCR needs search and lead forms. I&rsquo;ll recommend the smallest set of channels that can realistically hit your goal with your budget, and say no to the rest.']),
 ],
 cards=[('Strategy','Marketing strategy','Positioning, audience, offer and the channel mix, written down in a plan your team can actually follow.'),
  ('Digital','Digital marketing','Website, search, social, ads and email working towards one goal instead of five separate ones.'),
  ('Search','SEO services','Service pages, local SEO, Google Business Profile, technical basics and helpful articles.'),
  ('Ads','Performance marketing','Meta, Google and LinkedIn campaigns with creative built for each platform.'),
  ('Content','Content production','Photo, video and reels shot by me on a Sony A7 IV, so the content matches the strategy.'),
  ('Reporting','Monthly review','A short, readable report: what ran, what worked, what we change next month.')],
 steps=[('Discover','A working session on your business, buyers, competitors and current numbers.'),
  ('Plan','Positioning, channel mix, a 90-day roadmap and a monthly content plan.'),
  ('Produce & launch','Shoot days, pages, campaigns and posts go live in a planned order.'),
  ('Review','Monthly review of results and a clear list of changes for the next cycle.')],
 faqs=[('Are you a marketing agency or a consultant?','I&rsquo;m an independent marketing consultant and creator. I work alone, with no office or staff, and travel to clients. Some clients want strategy and direction for their in-house team; others want me to plan, produce and run the work, an agency-level service from one specialist. Either way you deal with me directly rather than an account manager.'),
  ('Which cities do you work in?','Brands across the UAE (Dubai and Abu Dhabi) and India (Bangalore, Mumbai and Delhi NCR). Strategy, SEO and ads run remotely; shoots happen on location.'),
  ('Do you offer SEO on its own?','Yes, for service businesses that want their website to work harder. It usually pairs naturally with content, because good pages need good photos and video.'),
  ('How is pricing worked out?','By scope: how many channels, how much content per month and whether you want strategy only or full execution. You get one written monthly or project quote before anything starts.'),
  ('What results can you promise?','I won&rsquo;t promise figures I can&rsquo;t control. I promise a clear plan, content made to a professional standard, honest reporting and quick changes when something isn&rsquo;t working.')],
 related=['brand-strategy.html','performance-marketing.html','social-media-marketing.html','linkedin-marketing.html','content-creation.html','video-production.html'],
)

P['performance'] = dict(
 slug='performance-marketing.html', key='Performance Marketing',
 title='Performance Marketing: Meta, Google & LinkedIn Ads',
 desc='Performance marketing for UAE and India brands: Meta ads, Google ads and LinkedIn ads, planned, built and run with ad creative I shoot myself.',
 h1='Performance Marketing', h1em='Meta, Google & LinkedIn Ads',
 eyebrow='Paid ads · Lead generation',
 lede='Paid campaigns on Meta, Google and LinkedIn, set up properly, tracked honestly and fed with ad creative I shoot myself. Built for brands in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Bangalore, Mumbai and Delhi that want enquiries and sales, not just impressions.',
 imgs='ads',
 sections=[
  ('Why creative is half of performance marketing', [
   'Ad platforms have automated most of the targeting. Meta&rsquo;s Advantage+ campaigns and Google&rsquo;s Performance Max decide a lot of who sees your ad. What they can&rsquo;t do is make your ad worth watching. That makes the creative, meaning the first three seconds of a reel, the product shot, the headline, the single most controllable lever left.',
   'This is where my background is useful. I&rsquo;ve spent 8 years shooting content, including a campaign reel that reached 3.3 million views and work for Vaseline (Unilever) and Marriott. When I plan a campaign I plan the shoot in the same sitting, so we produce a set of variations (hooks, formats, aspect ratios) designed to be tested, not one hero video that has to carry everything.']),
  ('Meta ads (Facebook & Instagram)', [
   'Meta is where demand gets created. People weren&rsquo;t searching for you, but a good reel makes them want what you sell. I use it for consumer brands, restaurants, real estate launches, events, clinics and D2C products. Setup covers the pixel and Conversions API, a simple account structure, audiences built from your customer data where allowed, lead forms or landing pages, and a creative testing rhythm.']),
  ('Google ads (Search, Performance Max, YouTube)', [
   'Google is where existing demand gets captured. Someone searching &ldquo;corporate video production Dubai&rdquo; is ready to talk. I build search campaigns around high-intent keywords with tight ad groups and negative keyword lists, set up conversion tracking with Google Tag Manager and GA4, and use Performance Max or YouTube only when there is enough creative and data to feed them.']),
  ('LinkedIn ads', [
   'LinkedIn costs more per click, but it is the only platform where you can target by job title, company and seniority. For B2B services, SaaS, recruitment, education and professional firms that is often worth it. I use lead gen forms, document ads and short founder-led video, usually alongside a personal branding plan so your organic presence and your ads reinforce each other. More on that on the <a href="/linkedin-marketing.html">LinkedIn marketing</a> page.']),
  ('Ad creative production', [
   'Every campaign gets creative made for it: vertical reels for Reels and Stories, square and portrait statics, UGC-style talking-head videos, product shots and short cut-downs for YouTube. It&rsquo;s shot on a Sony A7 IV with prime lenses, stabilised on a DJI RS3 gimbal with clean audio from a DJI wireless mic, and delivered in every size the platforms need.']),
  ('What I won&rsquo;t do', [
   'I won&rsquo;t quote you a ROAS before I&rsquo;ve seen your numbers, run campaigns without conversion tracking, or hide the ad account from you. The ad accounts stay in your name and you see the same dashboard I do.']),
 ],
 cards=[('Meta','Meta ads','Facebook and Instagram campaigns for demand creation, leads and sales.'),
  ('Google','Google ads','Search, Performance Max and YouTube for high-intent buyers.'),
  ('LinkedIn','LinkedIn ads','B2B targeting by title, company and seniority with lead gen forms.'),
  ('Creative','Ad creative production','Hooks, reels, statics and UGC-style variations shot for testing.'),
  ('Tracking','Conversion tracking','Pixel, Conversions API, GA4 and Tag Manager set up before spend.'),
  ('Landing','Landing pages','Focused pages that match the ad and make enquiry easy.')],
 steps=[('Audit','Review existing accounts, tracking, offers and past creative.'),
  ('Build','Tracking, account structure, audiences and the first creative batch.'),
  ('Launch & test','Campaigns go live with planned creative and audience tests.'),
  ('Optimise','Weekly adjustments and a monthly review with fresh creative.')],
 faqs=[('Meta ads or Google ads: which should I start with?','If people already search for what you sell, start with Google Search. If you need to create demand or your product sells visually, start with Meta. Many businesses end up using both. I wrote a longer comparison in the journal: <a href="/blog/meta-ads-vs-google-ads-dubai.html">Meta ads vs Google ads for Dubai businesses</a>.'),
  ('Do you manage the ad budget?','You pay the platforms directly from your own ad accounts. My fee covers strategy, setup, creative and management, so the spend is always visible to you.'),
  ('Do you make the ad creative too?','Yes. That&rsquo;s the main difference. Ad creative is shot and delivered by YKS Productions, so campaigns aren&rsquo;t waiting on a separate production company.'),
  ('Is LinkedIn advertising worth it?','For B2B offers with a meaningful deal size, often yes. For low-ticket consumer products, usually not. I&rsquo;ll tell you honestly which camp you&rsquo;re in.'),
  ('How soon will I see results?','Expect the first few weeks to be a learning period while platforms gather data and we test creative. Decisions get made on real numbers, not guesses.')],
 related=['marketing.html','linkedin-marketing.html','content-creation.html','social-media-marketing.html','brand-strategy.html'],
)

P['brand'] = dict(
 slug='brand-strategy.html', key='Brand Strategy',
 title='Brand Strategy & Content Strategy | YKS Productions',
 desc='Brand strategy and content strategy for growing brands in the UAE and India: positioning, messaging, visual direction and a content plan you can shoot.',
 h1='Brand Strategy', h1em='& Content Strategy',
 eyebrow='Positioning · Messaging · Content',
 lede='A brand is what people say about you when you&rsquo;re not in the room. Brand strategy decides what that should be; content strategy decides how you show it every week. I do both, and because I also shoot, the plan ends in content you can actually publish.',
 imgs='brand',
 sections=[
  ('Brand strategy without the 80-page deck', [
   'Good brand strategy fits on a few pages: who you serve, the problem you solve better than anyone else, the one idea you want to own, your tone of voice, and how all of it should look on camera. Long decks tend to sit in a shared drive. Short, sharp ones get used.',
   'My perspective comes from 8 years of making content for other people&rsquo;s brands, from Vaseline (Unilever) and Marriott to KL Rahul and Cindrebay School of Design, plus unit stills on the films Soothravakyam and Baby Girl. Working on sets and campaigns teaches you quickly what a brand looks like when it&rsquo;s clear, and how much time gets wasted when it isn&rsquo;t.']),
  ('Content strategy: from idea to calendar', [
   'Content strategy turns the brand into a repeatable publishing system. I define three to five content pillars, the formats each one uses (reels, carousels, long-form video, articles), the hooks and stories that fit your audience, and a realistic cadence. Then I build a calendar around shoot days so production is batched and efficient. One well-planned shoot day can cover a month of content.']),
  ('Visual direction', [
   'Most brand guidelines stop at logos and colours. I add the things that matter on camera: lighting style, framing, colour grade reference, wardrobe and location notes, and examples of what on-brand and off-brand look like. That gives every future photographer, videographer or designer a brief they can follow.']),
  ('Personal branding for founders', [
   'For many businesses the founder is the brand. Founder-led content on LinkedIn and Instagram builds trust faster than a logo ever will. I help founders and professionals define what they want to be known for, then plan and shoot the portraits, talking-head videos and stories that back it up. See <a href="/linkedin-marketing.html">LinkedIn marketing &amp; personal branding</a>.']),
 ],
 cards=[('Position','Positioning','Audience, category, the problem you solve and the one idea you own.'),
  ('Voice','Messaging & tone','Key messages, taglines and how the brand speaks on each channel.'),
  ('Visual','Visual direction','Lighting, framing, grade and styling references for every shoot.'),
  ('Pillars','Content pillars','The 3–5 themes your content returns to, with formats for each.'),
  ('Calendar','Content calendar','A monthly plan tied to shoot days and campaigns.'),
  ('Founder','Personal branding','Positioning and content for founders and leaders.')],
 steps=[('Listen','Interviews with you, a look at customers, competitors and past content.'),
  ('Define','Positioning, messaging and visual direction drafted and refined with you.'),
  ('Plan','Content pillars, formats and a 90-day calendar.'),
  ('Prove it','A first shoot that turns the strategy into real content.')],
 faqs=[('What do I actually receive?','A short brand strategy document, a visual direction guide with reference frames, and a content strategy with pillars and a calendar. Optionally, the first shoot.'),
  ('How long does brand strategy take?','Usually a few weeks, depending on how many people need to be involved in decisions.'),
  ('Do you design logos?','No. I focus on positioning, messaging, visual direction and content. If you need a new identity, I&rsquo;ll brief a designer using the strategy.'),
  ('Is content strategy useful without brand strategy?','It works, but it&rsquo;s weaker. If your positioning is already clear, we can start straight with content strategy.')],
 related=['marketing.html','content-creation.html','linkedin-marketing.html','video-production.html','photography.html'],
)

P['social'] = dict(
 slug='social-media-marketing.html', key='Social Media Marketing',
 title='Social Media Marketing, Influencer & UGC | YKS',
 desc='Social media marketing for brands in Dubai and India: strategy, reels, UGC, influencer and creator marketing, and management from a working creator.',
 h1='Social Media Marketing', h1em='Reels, UGC & Creators',
 eyebrow='Instagram · TikTok · LinkedIn · YouTube',
 lede='Social media marketing run by a working content creator. My own Instagram, @yks_photoworks, has passed 1.4 million profile views, and one campaign reel I made reached 3.3 million views. I bring that same understanding of what makes people stop scrolling to your brand.',
 imgs='social',
 sections=[
  ('Social media marketing that starts with content', [
   'Scheduling tools and posting calendars are easy to buy. The scarce part is content that people actually want to watch. Most social media packages fail because the strategy is decent but the content is generic stock, rushed phone clips or templates. I plan the strategy and shoot the content myself, so what goes out looks like it belongs to your brand.']),
  ('Reels & short-form video', [
   'Short-form vertical video is where most reach lives on Instagram, TikTok and YouTube Shorts. A strong reel has a hook in the first second, one idea, a clear payoff and sound designed for both muted and unmuted viewing. I plan reels in series rather than one-offs, so we learn which hooks and formats work and make more of them.']),
  ('UGC content', [
   'UGC (user-generated-style content) is talking-to-camera, phone-style content that feels native to the feed. Brands use it in organic posts and, especially, in ads, because it often feels more trustworthy than polished production. I script and shoot UGC-style content with real customers, staff, founders or talent, keeping the authentic look while making sure audio and lighting are clean.']),
  ('Influencer & creator marketing', [
   'Partnering with creators can put your brand in front of an audience that already trusts someone. As a creator myself, I know how these partnerships look from the other side. I help brands define the brief, shortlist creators who fit the audience rather than chasing follower counts, agree usage rights, and plan content so it can be reused in ads. I keep it practical: clear deliverables, clear rights, clear tracking links or codes.']),
  ('Management & community', [
   'Captions, scheduling, stories, replies and a monthly review. I keep management lean and focused on what helps you grow: the posts that work get more like them, and the ones that don&rsquo;t get dropped.']),
 ],
 cards=[('Strategy','Social strategy','Platforms, pillars, hooks and cadence based on your audience.'),
  ('Reels','Reels & short-form','Vertical video series planned around tested hooks and formats.'),
  ('UGC','UGC content','Authentic talking-head and demo content for posts and ads.'),
  ('Creators','Influencer & creator marketing','Briefs, shortlists, usage rights and reusable content.'),
  ('Photo','Photo content','Product, lifestyle and portrait photography for the feed.'),
  ('Manage','Management','Captions, scheduling, community and monthly reporting.')],
 steps=[('Audit','Your channels, competitors and the content gaps holding you back.'),
  ('Plan','Pillars, formats and a monthly calendar with shoot days.'),
  ('Shoot','Batch shoot days covering reels, photos and UGC.'),
  ('Publish & learn','Posting, community and monthly review of what to repeat.')],
 faqs=[('Which platforms do you cover?','Instagram, TikTok, YouTube Shorts and LinkedIn. I&rsquo;ll recommend focusing on the one or two where your buyers are.'),
  ('Can you run influencer campaigns?','Yes. I handle the brief, shortlisting, rights and content planning. I don&rsquo;t publicise which creators I&rsquo;ve worked with; past brand work includes Vaseline (Unilever), Marriott and Cindrebay School of Design.'),
  ('What is UGC and do I need it?','UGC-style content is native-looking, talking-to-camera content. If you run Meta or TikTok ads, it&rsquo;s usually worth testing alongside polished creative.'),
  ('How much content do I get per month?','It depends on the package. A typical setup bundles a set number of reels, photos and stories from one or two shoot days. You agree the exact numbers before we start.'),
  ('Do you work outside Dubai and Bangalore?','Yes. Abu Dhabi, Mumbai and Delhi NCR too, with shoot days planned around travel.')],
 related=['content-creation.html','performance-marketing.html','brand-strategy.html','marketing.html','social-media-marketing-dubai.html','social-media-marketing-bangalore.html'],
)

P['linkedin'] = dict(
 slug='linkedin-marketing.html', key='LinkedIn Marketing',
 title='LinkedIn Marketing & Personal Branding | YKS',
 desc='LinkedIn marketing, LinkedIn ads and personal branding for founders and B2B brands in Dubai, Bangalore, Mumbai and Delhi. Strategy, photos and video.',
 h1='LinkedIn Marketing', h1em='& Personal Branding',
 eyebrow='LinkedIn ads · Founder content',
 lede='For B2B companies, consultants and founders, LinkedIn is where buyers form opinions before they ever take a call. I help you show up there well: a clear personal brand, professional portraits and video, a posting rhythm, and LinkedIn ads when they make sense.',
 imgs='linkedin',
 sections=[
  ('Personal branding on LinkedIn', [
   'People buy from people. A founder who posts thoughtfully every week builds more trust than a company page posting announcements. Personal branding starts with clarity: what you want to be known for, who you want to reach and what you can say that others can&rsquo;t. From there we build a small set of content pillars drawn from your real experience.',
   'I then handle the parts most founders struggle with: professional portraits that don&rsquo;t look like stock, short talking-head videos that are lit and miked properly (DJI wireless mic, Sony A7 IV), carousel ideas and a cadence you can keep up. You stay the voice; I make it easier and better-looking.']),
  ('LinkedIn ads for B2B', [
   'LinkedIn ads let you reach decision-makers by job title, function, seniority, company size and industry. They work best for offers with real deal value: B2B services, SaaS, education, recruitment and professional firms. I typically use lead gen forms, document ads and thought-leadership ads built from a founder&rsquo;s posts, with tight audiences and conversion tracking. It pairs with the rest of your <a href="/performance-marketing.html">performance marketing</a>.']),
  ('Company pages that look credible', [
   'Banner, About section, featured content, team photos and a showcase of real work. Small details, but buyers check them.']),
  ('Who it suits', [
   'Founders raising awareness or funding, consultants and agencies selling high-value services, leadership teams at growing companies, and professionals moving into a new market, for example relocating between India and the UAE.']),
 ],
 cards=[('Profile','Profile overhaul','Headline, About, featured section and a professional portrait.'),
  ('Pillars','Content pillars','Themes drawn from your real expertise and stories.'),
  ('Video','Talking-head video','Short founder videos, properly lit and recorded.'),
  ('Photo','LinkedIn portraits','Headshots and environmental portraits that feel like you.'),
  ('Ads','LinkedIn ads','Lead gen, document and thought-leadership ads for B2B.'),
  ('Company','Company page','Banner, about, featured work and team visuals.')],
 steps=[('Interview','A conversation to find your expertise, stories and goals.'),
  ('Position','Profile rewrite, pillars and a realistic posting plan.'),
  ('Shoot','Portrait and video session for a bank of content.'),
  ('Publish & amplify','Regular posts, with ads layered on where useful.')],
 faqs=[('Do you write my posts for me?','We work from your ideas and voice. I help shape, structure and plan them; the opinions stay yours.'),
  ('Are LinkedIn ads expensive?','Clicks cost more than on Meta, so they suit offers with higher deal values. I&rsquo;ll tell you if your offer doesn&rsquo;t fit.'),
  ('Can you shoot LinkedIn headshots in Dubai?','Yes. See <a href="/linkedin-headshots-dubai.html">LinkedIn headshots in Dubai</a> and <a href="/corporate-headshots-dubai.html">corporate headshots</a>.'),
  ('How long until personal branding pays off?','It compounds over months, not weeks. Consistency matters more than any single viral post.')],
 related=['performance-marketing.html','brand-strategy.html','marketing.html','video-production.html','blog/linkedin-personal-branding-founders-mumbai.html'],
)

